/**
 * Rechecks every captured version and the account's active state, then
 * writes the repair, any confirmed unlinking and the audit in one
 * transaction. If the preview requires unlinking, `confirmUnlinking` must
 * be true (409 `unlink_confirmation_required`); declining simply means
 * not applying. Stale previews return 409 `preview_stale`, expired ones
 * 410. Re-applying an applied preview returns its recorded result.
 * @summary Confirm and apply a reviewed repair atomically
 */
